				2.45a
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέγχρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					3.112a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιόδους</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.77a
			</span></i>.</div>
